   "daf": "95a",
   "sentenceId": 5,
   "he": "רַבִּי יוֹסֵי אוֹמֵר: אִם מוּתָּרִין. אִיבַּעְיָא לְהוּ רַבִּי יוֹסֵי לֶאֱסוֹר, אוֹ לְהַתִּיר?",
   "en": "We learned in the mishna: «Rabbi Yosei says: If they are permitted» to carry there on that Shabbat, they are likewise permitted to do so in the future, and if they are prohibited from carrying there in the future, they are also prohibited from carrying there on that Shabbat «A dilemma was raised before» the Sages: Did «Rabbi Yosei» intend «to prohibit» carrying even on that Shabbat, «or to permit» carrying even in the future?"
  }
